#    Full lifecycle: Add ‥ View ‥ Edit ‥ Delete ‥ Auto-Fire Runner
#    DB Collection: bot2_broadcasts (status=’scheduled’ until fired, then ’sent’)
#    FSM states: PowerStates.sched_bc_* (add/edit/delete/view flow)
